    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jeremia na Warekabi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matuku gha Jehoiakimu mwana wa Josia, mzuri wa Juda, BWANA oreghorieghe nani ukighamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2 Waz. 23.36–24.6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.5+2CH.36.6+2CH.36.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mal. 36.5-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghenda kwa wandu wa kichuku cha Warekabi kudedanye nawo; kuwirede andenyi ya chimu cha vumba va Hekalu ya BWANA; nao kuwineke divei winyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ngammbwada Jaazania mwana wa Jeremia wawae Habazinia, na waruna na wana wake wose, na wandu wa kichuku cha Warekabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngawireda andenyi ya Hekalu ya BWANA, andenyi ya chumba cha wana wa Hanani mwana wa Igdalia, mundu wa Mlungu; cherekoghe kaavui na chumba cha wabaa, naighu ya chumba cha Maaseia mwana wa Shalumu, mlindiri mnyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ngawika bakuli na vikombe vichue divei imbiri ya Warekabi ngawizera, “Nyonyi divei.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela wikatumbulia, “Isi ndedinywaghwa divei ingi, kwa kukaia aba Jonadabu mwana wa Rekabu oredilaghirieghe, ‘Inyo jingi msenyo divei, hata wana wenyu kwa kala na kala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mseaghe nyumba hata kuwa mbeu, msewe, angu kukaia na mbuwa ra mizabibu; ela mchakaia hemenyi matuku ghenyu ghose, mpate kukaia matuku mengi isangenyi mjighendiagha.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damerie kusikira malaghiro ghose dighorelo ni aba odu Jonadabu mwana wa Rekabu, seji udizerie disenyo divei marangi ghedu ghose, isi hata waka wedu, hata wana wedu wa womi na wa waka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hata disakeagha nyumba rekaia. Isi ndediwadie mbuwa ra mizabibu, hata mbuwa hata mbeu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela dadakaia hemenyi, nesi damerie kumsikira na kubonya ghose dilaghirilo ni aba odu Jonadabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela iji Nebukadnezari mzuri wa Babuloni orechieghe kulwa na iji isanga, dereghambieghe, ‘Choonyi dijoke Jerusalemu kwa wundu ghoobua ijeshi ja Wababuloni na ijeshi ja Wasiria.’ Kwa huwo dadakaia Jerusalemu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko BWANA ukaghora nani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA wa majeshi, Mlungu wa Israeli wanizerie nighende niwizere wandu wa Juda na awo wikaiagha Jerusalemu, “Welee, moolegha mafundisho, na kuleghasikira malagho ghapo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaghiro Jonadabu mwana wa Rekabu ulaghirie wana wake wisenyo divei, waghiwadie; nawo ndewinywagha divei hata linu, kwa kukaia wamsikire ndee. Ini naghorie nenyo sena na sena, ela ndemunisikire anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadumie wadumiki wapo walodi wose konyu sena na sena ngimzera kula umu onyu ughaluke kufuma kwa chia rake mbiwi, m'boise mighendo yenyu. Msakenugha milungu mizima na kuidumikia, nenyo mchakaia isangenyi neremnekieghe inyo na weke ndeyo. Ela ndemdeghie madu kusikira, hata kusikira ndemusikire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wa Jonadabu mwana wa Rekabu wamazirie malaghiro werenekeloghe ni ndee, ela awa wandu ndewinisikire ini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo ini BWANA, Mlungu wa majeshi, Mlungu wa Israeli naghamba huwu, Olenyi nichawiredia wandu wa Juda, na wose wikaiagha Jerusalemu mawiwi ghose nighighorie aighu yawo; kwa kukaia naghorie nawo wikalegha kusikira, ngawiwanga nawo wikalegha kudika.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela kwa Warekabi Jeremia ukaghamba, “BWANA wa majeshi, Mlungu wa Israeli waghamba kukaia: Kwa kukaia mwamsikire ndeyo Jonadabu, na kunugha malaghiro ghake, mkabonya agho ghose umlaghirie, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA wa majeshi, Mlungu wa Israeli waghamba huwu, Jonadabu mwana wa Rekabu jingi ndechaasowa mundu onidumikia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
